@startuml
title III-04 - Verified-purchase feedback and rating

autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Customer
boundary "Customer Portal" as Web
control "Feedback API" as API
database "CRM Database" as DB

Customer -> Web: Enter rating and comment
Web -> API: POST /api/products/{productId}/feedback\n(JWT, orderId, rating, comment)
API -> API: Verify JWT and customer identity

alt Invalid or missing JWT
    API --> Web: 401 UNAUTHORIZED
    Web --> Customer: Redirect to login
else Authenticated customer
    API -> DB: Lock order by orderId and verify ownership
    DB --> API: Order for current customer
    API -> API: Require order.status == COMPLETED
    note right of DB
      Feedback is allowed only after the customer
      confirms receipt and the order is COMPLETED.
    end note

    alt No eligible purchase
        API --> Web: 403 RECEIPT_REQUIRED
        Web --> Customer: Show receipt-required message
    else Eligible purchase exists
        API -> API: Verify product belongs to the order
        API -> DB: Create feedback record
        note right of DB
          The service prevents duplicate feedback
          for the same order and product.
        end note

        alt Create succeeds
            DB --> API: Feedback created
            API --> Web: 201 Created
            Web --> Customer: Show submitted feedback
        else Duplicate feedback rule triggered
            DB --> API: Feedback already exists
            API --> Web: 409 DUPLICATE_FEEDBACK
            Web --> Customer: Show already-submitted message
        end
    end
end

@enduml
